      "text": "AICON\nABOUT\nAICON'26\nEDITION\nFrom humble origins to becoming a beacon of\nintellectual exchange,\nAIMUNSOC continues\nto\ninspire,\nelevate,\nand\nempower\nchangemakers.\na\ngeneration of thinkers\nand\nAfter\nthe\nresounding\nsuccess\nof\nour\ninaugural\nconference,\nAIMUNSOC\nproudly\nunveils the Third Edition of its flagship\nevent: AiCon'26.\nThis year, we raise the bar even higher,\npromising\na\ndynamic\nconfluence\nof\ndiplomacy, dialogue, and discovery. With a\nrenowned Executive Board, a visionary\nSecretariat, and an array of intellectually\ncharged\ncommittees,\nAiCon'26 is set to\ndeliver\nstimulating\ndebate\nsessions,\nunparalleled networking opportunities, and\nthe chance to engage with delegates from\nacross\nthe spectrum.\nWhether you're a\nseasoned delegate or a curious first timer,\nthis is your moment to refine your\nrhetoric,challenge\nyour worldview,\nand\nimmerse yourself in the world of global\naffairs.\nWe warmly invite you to be a part of this\nextraordinary journey AiCon'26 awaits your\npresence and participation.",
